# ASIA

### 'Dear ChatGPT': 12-year-old wins top youth prize at Australian Poetry Slam – video
Source: The Guardian
https://www.theguardian.com/technology/video/2026/oct/26/dear-chatgpt-12-year-old-wins-top-youth-prize-at-australian-poetry-slam-video

'Dear ChatGPT': 12-year-old wins top youth prize at Australian Poetry Slam – video Blake Mackenzie, a 12-year-old from Newcastle, has won the top youth prize at the Australian Poetry Slam for his reflections on artificial intelligence. The winning piece, performed at the Sydney Opera House on Sunday night, covered doomscrolling, loneliness and intellectual atrophy. The Australian Poetry Slam competition is now in its 22nd year. It ran 65 heats in 60 towns and cities across the country to find 16 finalists.

